The basic ax25 libraries, tools and applications can be downloaded from:
http://sourceforge.net/projects/ax25/
I am not certain if anyone has rpms for the current versions available
or not.

The AX.25 HOWTO <http://www.linuxdoc.org/HOWTO/AX25-HOWTO/> and the
Linux Ham Radio Database <http://radio.linux.org.au/> are very useful
sources of information.

